#doc (Manual) "Programming Languages" =>

Lecture notes of course 09022, Linguagens de Programação, of the Computer Engineering programme of the Instituto Militar de Engenharia. The course studies the meaning of the constructions of programming languages. It follows the structure of Watt and presents each construction as part of Core C++, a well behaved subset of C++17, with typing and evaluation rules in natural semantics and their implementation in Lean 4. Unit I, Introduction, takes the first four lectures, Unit II, Types, the next four, and Unit III, Storage and Control, Lectures 9 to 12.

